    "catalogue_description": "GUESS WHO\u2019S BACK?! YES I\u2019M BACK! It\u2019s been a while but I decided to go ahead and make my 4th zombies map, previously I had worked on a Family Guy map for Yoteslaya before he died, I know Syndicate or SyndicateProject plays custom zombies and was going to make a map for him but I chose The Sidemen, a group of YouTubers from the UK consisting of KSI, ZerkaaHD, Miniminter, TBJZL, Behzinga, Vikkstar and Wroetoshaw. I spent just over two weeks making this map and adding a lot of custom scripting. Special thanks to everyone here at ZM, CFGFactory and Others on YouTube including: Tom_BMX Yaph1l ZK (Zombie K1ller) Earth Harry Bo21 ADDICTED Holty007 And Many More! DISCLAIMER: This map is currently a beta as there are few glitches in this map which I have requested help on but haven\u2019t had any luck on. I will edit and re-upload the completed map when it\u2019s all finished. Hope you guys will enjoy it, my other maps have had positive feedback in the past and have been featured on NGT Zombies YouTube channel",
